   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Governance results and evidence system (REX). To analyse the contribution and attribution of programmes and other interventions to governance outcomes and impact across DFID&apos;s portfolio. is a component of International support to encourage the implementation of Sustainable Development Goals 16  - Peace, justice and strong institutions reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;45,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
